From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: dianqk <dianqk@dianqk.net>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 14:47:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 01/10] arm64: dts: qcom: add SM8475 core support for Y700

Consolidate SM8475 SoC description, pinctrl, CPUFreq, eUSB2 repeater
and UBWC support for Linux 7.3. This integrates work by Danila Tikhonov
and Jens Reidel with local 7.2.6 adaptations.

Component-source: lenovo-basements/linux f2001d2ce0c472d5d96663695573da25c57d2fa2
Component-source: lenovo-basements/linux 6b108adc77b9b92cb0b15d7209df2e24dc61775f
Component-source: lenovo-basements/linux 05995df8d11370db83d9f03139c1c640c61118e4
Component-source: lenovo-basements/linux 1d13bf94b75bb88ec88de877d146049fb4ca60f7
Component-source: lenovo-basements/linux 371349d9866bd4a9b3144c058603d10576c0955c
---
